{"1192900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "IRON REBELLION", "steam_appid": 1192900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built exclusively for virtual reality and designed for seated play, Iron Rebellion delivers a hands-on piloting experience unlike traditional mech games</strong>.<strong> Climb inside the cockpit of a towering war machine, reach for switches, manage power systems, operate weapons, and physically control every aspect of your mech as you battle for supremacy on the battlefield.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Multiplayer Warfare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form elite 8v8 squads to dominate the fight in multiple game modes. Victory depends on teamwork and smart decision-making. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No squad? No problem. Play against bots as you master your skills throughout different game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/extras/2a421ac4f554fc4211aeff53e41305cf.poster.avif?t=1787155660\" width=620 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/extras/2a421ac4f554fc4211aeff53e41305cf.webm?t=1787155660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/extras/2a421ac4f554fc4211aeff53e41305cf.mp4?t=1787155660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Six Unique Mech Classes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from six specialized mech classes, each designed for different combat roles and playstyles. Customize your loadout, install augments, refine your strategy, and create a machine tailored to your approach.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cross-Platform VR Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight alongside pilots on both PCVR and standalone Quest through a seamless cross-platform multiplayer integration. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/extras/d9d5fe8faea15e8e846ab5ac9f923804.poster.avif?t=1787155660\" width=620 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/extras/d9d5fe8faea15e8e846ab5ac9f923804.webm?t=1787155660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/extras/d9d5fe8faea15e8e846ab5ac9f923804.mp4?t=1787155660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/extras/79d49ed4042d9ede0965539a6e2f02e6.poster.avif?t=1787155660\" width=620 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/extras/79d49ed4042d9ede0965539a6e2f02e6.webm?t=1787155660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/extras/79d49ed4042d9ede0965539a6e2f02e6.mp4?t=1787155660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/extras/d053d4b57e6e9a743f071445997401ee.poster.avif?t=1787155660\" width=620 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/extras/d053d4b57e6e9a743f071445997401ee.webm?t=1787155660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"