ned for different combat roles and playstyles. Customize your loadout, install augments, refine your strategy, and create a machine tailored to your approach.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cross-Platform VR Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight alongside pilots on both PCVR and standalone Quest through a seamless cross-platform multiplayer integration. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/extras/d9d5fe8faea15e8e846ab5ac9f923804.poster.avif?t=1787155660\" width=620 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/extras/d9d5fe8faea15e8e846ab5ac9f923804.webm?t=1787155660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/extras/d9d5fe8faea15e8e846ab5ac9f923804.mp4?t=1787155660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/extras/79d49ed4042d9ede0965539a6e2f02e6.poster.avif?t=1787155660\" width=620 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/extras/79d49ed4042d9ede0965539a6e2f02e6.webm?t=1787155660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/extras/79d49ed4042d9ede0965539a6e2f02e6.mp4?t=1787155660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/extras/d053d4b57e6e9a743f071445997401ee.poster.avif?t=1787155660\" width=620 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/extras/d053d4b57e6e9a743f071445997401ee.webm?t=1787155660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/extras/d053d4b57e6e9a743f071445997401ee.mp4?t=1787155660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Have More Questions?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into our Discord and join an active community of other mech pilots.</p>", "short_description": "Step inside a colossal war machine and experience what it means to be a mech pilot. Control every switch, weapon, and system from the cockpit, customize your mech for battle, and outmaneuver rival pilots in tactical cross-platform multiplayer combat.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Superb and probably one of the BEST mech games in VR! - Think HAWKEN but better!”<br>Paradise Decay Game Reviews<br><br>“Iron Rebellion's Warzone Mode and the new Foundations Update is nuts. I look forward to getting stepped on by twice as many giant robots now.”<br>habie147<br><br>“I'm an old-school BattleTech / MechWarrior fan, and so Iron Rebellion is like a dream come true. To be honest, this is what we wished those early simulators were like back in the day.”<br>Founder, SIM Gaming Expo<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/10384cb457c60626a8634f836e3bf588cc7a7c59/header.jpg?t=1787155660", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/3276651587a6fdb9954e4b8a52403d2ee9082076/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787155660", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192900/3276651587a6fdb9954e4b8a52403d2ee9082076/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787155660", "website"